<title>USA: EastGroup Properties sell apts, sees gain.</title>
<headline>EastGroup Properties sell apts, sees gain.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>EastGroup Properties said on Monday it had sold two apartment complexes, one in Houston, and the other in Wichita, Kansas, for a total price of $6.16 million.</p>
<p>The sale generated a gain of about $2.9 million, or $0.42 per share for the Trust, it said.</p>
